posts.body:
I got so excited when I got an e-mail from Itch about this a couple of days ago. I thought it was out already. ;.;
Loving the screenshots and cast so far. (That gnome hat person is adorable
) I'll patiently wait for more info.

@Finnuval
Thanks! There'll definitely be a party if the player gets the good ending, and a beach party is a great idea! It'd be nice to have fireworks too - I looked for some fireworks animations a long time ago but have never found them.
@slimmmeiske2
Good to hear that! The windowskin and the tabs at the top are edits from the Krachware User Interface Material Variety Pack DLC.

Good to know that you're a fan of the gardener gnome,
@slimmmeiske2
! And that's a great suggestion too regarding the benches - thanks!

Thanks so much for playing,
@slimmmeiske2
, and for the feedback as well as the bug reports - I'll fix them in the full release. Glad you enjoyed the demo!

Thanks,
@Finnuval
! You gave very useful feedback on the first game, so I'm looking forward to seeing what you think of this game when you get the chance to play it.

I'm sure anything from you,
@SeaPhoenix
will be just another great game! So even if not an inn keeping next time, I'm still in!
